---

@BEGIN title="雨夜的告白"

@ACT id=1 title="雨夜广场"

@SCENE id=plaza time=evening weather=rain

@CAST actor=mira
@CAST actor=old_chen

@SPAWN_WALKWAY id=plaza_rain_path from=(10, 5.85) to=(28, 5.85) width=1.2
@SPAWN_WALKWAY id=plaza_rain_north_left from=(19.5, 5.85) to=(19.5, 10) width=1.2
@SPAWN_WALKWAY id=plaza_rain_north_right from=(20.5, 5.85) to=(20.5, 10) width=1.2

@LAYOUT id=plaza_rain_row

@ENTER actor=mira at=(10, 5.85) facing=south
@MOVE_TO actor=mira to_path=plaza_rain_path x=10.6
@SIT actor=mira bench=bench_1 seat=0

@ENTER actor=old_chen at=(28, 5.85) facing=south
@SPAWN_PROP prop=umbrella id=umbrella_1 attach=old_chen offset=(0.4, 0) state=open
@CUT preset=cam_follow target=mira

@NARRATION duration=2.5
雨点敲打着广场的石板路，路灯在水洼里碎成一片金光。

@DIALOGUE speaker=mira auto=true auto_delay=2.5
「今晚的雨，好像永远不会停。」
@END

@MOVE_TO actor=old_chen to_path=plaza_rain_path x=21

@DIALOGUE speaker=old_chen auto=true auto_delay=2.5
「年轻人，伞借你一半。」
@END

@STAND actor=mira

@DIALOGUE speaker=mira auto=true auto_delay=2
「谢谢您，陈伯。我这就过来。」
@END

@PARALLEL
  @MOVE_TO actor=mira to_path=plaza_rain_path duo_center=0.556 duo_side=left
  @MOVE_TO actor=old_chen to_path=plaza_rain_path duo_center=0.556 duo_side=right
@END

@DIALOGUE speaker=mira auto=true auto_delay=2
「有伞真好，雨声也没那么冷了。」
@END

@DIALOGUE speaker=old_chen auto=true auto_delay=2.5
「一起走一段吧。」
@END

@PARALLEL
  @MOVE_TO actor=mira to_path=plaza_rain_path duo_center=0.72 duo_side=left
  @MOVE_TO actor=old_chen to_path=plaza_rain_path duo_center=0.72 duo_side=right
@END

@DIALOGUE speaker=mira auto=true auto_delay=2
「雨夜广场，走起来也没那么孤单了。」
@END

@FACE actor=mira facing=north
@FACE actor=old_chen facing=north

@PARALLEL
  @MOVE_TO actor=mira to_path=plaza_rain_north_left y=10
  @MOVE_TO actor=old_chen to_path=plaza_rain_north_right y=10
@END

@NARRATION duration=2.5
两个人肩并肩走在雨中，广场的灯光忽然变得柔和起来。

@END_SCRIPT
